@api = http://localhost:5080

### Users (no header needed)
GET {{api}}/api/users

### Customers
GET {{api}}/api/customers
X-User-Id: 1

### Quote a policy (nothing is saved)
POST {{api}}/api/policies/quote
X-User-Id: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": 1, "type": "Motor", "sumInsured": 500000, "startDate": "2026-10-01" }

### Issue a policy (Agent or Manager)
POST {{api}}/api/policies
X-User-Id: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": 1, "type": "Motor", "sumInsured": 500000, "startDate": "2026-10-01" }

### File a claim (Agent)
POST {{api}}/api/claims
X-User-Id: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "policyId": 1, "incidentDate": "2026-10-05", "amount": 42000, "description": "Rear bumper damaged in a parking lot" }

### Review it (Adjuster)
POST {{api}}/api/claims/1/review
X-User-Id: 2

### Claim with its audit trail. Copy rowVersion from this response into approve, reject and pay.
GET {{api}}/api/claims/1
X-User-Id: 3

### Approve it (a different Adjuster, or a Manager)
POST {{api}}/api/claims/1/approve
X-User-Id: 3
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rowVersion": "AAAAAAAAB9E=" }

### Pay it (Manager)
POST {{api}}/api/claims/1/pay
X-User-Id: 4
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rowVersion": "AAAAAAAAB9I=" }

### Claims summary from the stored procedure
GET {{api}}/api/reports/claims-summary?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-12-31
X-User-Id: 4

### OpenAPI document
GET {{api}}/openapi/v1.json
